-# app/views/keyserver/analysis/_product_activity.html.haml
:css
  .data_summary th:not(:first-child) {
    max-width: 50px; 
    text-align: center !important;
  }
  .data_summary td:not(:first-child) {
    text-align: right !important;
  }

Filter by Division, User Group, and/or Affiliation to understand which products are being used.
%br
%br
%hr
%br

= render partial: "keyserver/shared/filter_form",
  locals: { filters: {division: true, user_group: true, affiliation: true }  }
%br
%hr
%section
  %h2 Product Activity

  * The number of installs includes staff computers, however usage does not contain staff information.
  %table.data_summary
    %thead
      %tr
        %th Product Name
        %th Unique Users
        %th Product Sessions
        %th Average Duration (minutes)
        %th Computers Used
        %th Number of Installs*
        %th Most Recent Use

    %tbody
      - @product_summary.each do |record|
        %tr
          %td= record.product_name
          %td= format_big_number(record.unique_users)
          %td= format_big_number(record.sessions)
          %td= format_into_minutes(record.avg_duration)
          %td= format_big_number(record.computers_used)
          %td= format_big_number(record.install_count)
          %td= record.most_recent_use&.to_date

%section
  %h2 Unused Products 

  %table.data_summary
    %thead
      %tr
        %th Product Name
        %th Number of Installs
    %tbody
      - @unused_products.each do |record|
        %tr
          %td= record.product_name
          %td= format_big_number(record.install_count)
